<title>UK: GENERAL ACCIDENT RISES ON H1 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GENERAL ACCIDENT RISES ON H1 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in General Accident Plc rose on Tuesday as the British composite insurer impressed the market with its interim results, dealers and analysts said.</p>
<p>At 0746 GMT, the shares were up 21-1/2p to 966-1/2, just 13-1/2p shy of their May 5 all-time high.</p>
